identify=Zone|Discraft|Z|green|unknown|8|15|Discraft Z Zone putt-and-approach with red foil first-run style stamp — repeated Zone wordmark in a rotating pinwheel layout with Z logos at the collar. Translucent green Z plastic. Stamp is intact but shows some foil scuffing and the flight-number box is faded. Light surface scratching and a couple of small scuffs on the flight plate; no ink and no name on the back. Zones are one of the hottest approach molds so this prices above an average used disc.
